            <ArticleTitle>Bardet-Biedl syndrome in two sisters: A rare incidence.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3233/PGE-13048</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Bardet-Biedl syndrome is an autosomal recessive disorder characterized by retinitis pigmentosa, obesity, polydactyly, mental retardation and hypogonadism. We present two sisters with this rare genetic condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
